### CampusEvents API – manual requests
### Open in VS Code (extension "REST Client") or PhpStorm and click "Send Request".
@base = http://localhost:8000/backend

### All events
GET {{base}}/events

### One event (200) and a missing one (404)
GET {{base}}/events/1

###
GET {{base}}/events/999

### Reviews of an event
GET {{base}}/events/9/reviews

### Create an event (201)
POST {{base}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Intro to Docker Workshop",
  "club_id": 2,
  "category_id": 2,
  "location": "FENS Lab 1",
  "city": "Sarajevo",
  "starts_at": "2026-12-03 17:00",
  "capacity": 25,
  "description": "Containers for your web project – bring a laptop."
}

### Invalid event (400)
POST {{base}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "", "club_id": 1, "category_id": 1, "location": "Hall", "starts_at": "2026-12-03 17:00", "capacity": 10 }

### Update an event (move the Movie Night to a bigger hall)
PUT {{base}}/events/5
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Movie Night: Classic Cinema", "club_id": 4, "category_id": 4, "location": "IBU Amphitheatre", "city": "Sarajevo", "starts_at": "2026-10-14 20:00", "capacity": 200 }

### Delete an event with registrations (400)
DELETE {{base}}/events/1

### Register for an event (201)
POST {{base}}/registrations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "user_id": 3, "event_id": 12 }

### Registrations of one student
GET {{base}}/registrations?user_id=2

### Cancel a registration
PUT {{base}}/registrations/1/cancel

### Mark a registration as attended
PUT {{base}}/registrations/4/attend

### Dashboard numbers
GET {{base}}/dashboard

### Unknown endpoint (404 JSON)
GET {{base}}/something

### ---------- External API (week 06) ----------

### 7-day forecast for a city
GET {{base}}/weather/forecast?city=Mostar&days=7

### Unknown city (404)
GET {{base}}/weather/forecast?city=Xqzzyy

### Weather on the day of an event (Welcome Concert)
GET {{base}}/events/1/weather

### Event more than 16 days ahead – available=false
GET {{base}}/events/11/weather

### v1 – raw Open-Meteo response
GET {{base}}/weather/v1/forecast?city=Sarajevo

### ---------- Step-by-step versions ----------

### v1 – not found, but status 200
GET {{base}}/event_by_id?id=999

### v1 – invalid, but status 200
POST {{base}}/add_event
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "" }

### v2 – 404
GET {{base}}/v2/events/999

### v2 – 400
POST {{base}}/v2/events
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "" }
